# global-arret-aux: Does an aux named arret take the place of the stop action (XPPAUT 8.2.2)?
# xpp: rows=21
# pc: ODE0058
# ruling: The aux name is found as a target, the assignment changes nothing that is kept, and the run goes on.
x'=1
x(0)=0
aux arret=x
global 1 x-0.55 {arret=1}
@ total=2,dt=0.1,meth=euler
